**FINAL ARCHITECTURAL STATEMENT**

Research finds evidence. Evidence constrains claims. Claims form models. Models
receive the representation appropriate to them. Active use tests understanding.
Contradictions revise understanding. Human decisions create authority. ADRs
authorize execution. Frozen Phase 1.5 executes the accepted decision. Production
evidence teaches Beacon what happened. **Continuity state is never trusted past its
own freshness window — this is now load-bearing, not aspirational.**
